{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"24358b2c9c3ecced","type":"text","text":"学历、文化背景、实习经历、近年经历","x":-880,"y":-480,"width":350,"height":60},
		{"id":"36b7090d072a372e","type":"text","text":"I only have a Vocational high school Diploma. In 2013, my school sent me to intern at a tire factory in Zhangjiagang, Jiangsu. but that job isn't suit me,  As thus, I found new job by online, and then I went to Shanghai alone. \nThat is a skill education company online. I work as teacher, and actually, the position is just a salesperson.\nI worked from 2016 to 2018 for two years. That's great time. I learned too much skills and extensive experience.\nFinally, Summer of 2018, I quitted my job and rented a house as a office. Yeah, I trained online with other two partners.\nMy partners were in charge recording course. For me, besides recording course, I also needed to do much work, such as managing website, reception learners.\nWe did a lot of work and were exhausted, **yet** we **didn't even make** much **money**. Though we were team, but we did things singly. Until the end of 2o19, in the end, we dissloved.\nFinally, I backed to my hometown. And next I attended my cousin's wedding. Then the coronavirus broke out. I didn't go out in 2020 due to the epidemic situation. I stayed in home as a freelancer. Until next year, I found a job in the local city as a photographer and video editor.\nI just worked there for less than a year and quit, and I became a freelancer again. In the end I still didn't make more money, so I went go to Guangzhou to find a job again.\nYeah, right now, I'm video editor and product photographer for an adult company, and I almost work for one year here.","x":-1125,"y":-181,"width":840,"height":450},
		{"id":"9c05490224cb5a98","type":"text","text":"对未来行业看法","x":120,"y":-480,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7d291a11d02c30df","x":-180,"y":-67,"width":860,"height":222,"type":"text","text":"When people ask me what I do, I tell them I'm **a** video editor. Most people say, 'Wow, that's cool!' But actually, the industry is getting **harder and harder**.\nAs a video editor, You need to master enough video edit softwares. Such as After Effects, premiere, and DaVinci Resolve ……\nYou know, software is becoming more and more powerful and easier to use, so a lot of beginners can master it easily.\nNowadays, AI tools are becoming more and more powerful and easier to use. Making videos isn't a difficult thing, and you can even create videos by typing text. You don't need to use any professional video editing software at all."},
		{"id":"5d8c5ac04f056a0d","type":"text","text":"# 职业经历","x":-320,"y":-480,"width":180,"height":60}
	],
